.TH SDL_DestroyRenderer 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_DestroyRenderer \- Destroy the rendering context for a window and free all associated textures.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_DestroyRenderer(SDL_Renderer *renderer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This should be called before destroying the associated window\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I renderer
the rendering context\[char46]
.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

